Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:20:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] sapphire: wcd937x: stereo external speaker glue

Replace the topaz single-PA glue with the sapphire one recovered from the
stock wcd937x_dlkm.ko: AUX EXT SPK / EAR EXT SPK DAPM widgets and routes,
AUX/EAR EXT SPK MODE and AUX PATH Mode controls, aw_profile[] and the
per-amplifier FourSemi scene tables dumped from the stock module.
Verified: identical function set, exports and DAPM routes to stock.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
